    {
      "name": "Agreement",
      "definition_uri": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/gist/Agreement",
      "description": "A mutually understood arrangement in which two or more parties make commitments to one another.",
      "title": "Agreement",
      "notes": [
        "OWL equivalentClass: (gist:Intention & \u2203hasParty.(gist:Organization | gist:Person) & \u22652^isDirectPartOf.gist:Commitment)"
      ],
      "comments": [
        "While an agreement has two or more parties, and contains commitments which bind those parties, it will not always be necessary to instantiate each individual commitment."
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "value": "A gym membership is an agreement in which the member commits to paying the gym a certain price and the gym commits to allowing access to their facilities.",
          "@type": "Example"
        }
